        "TileImage": "$($repository 22d11922-70e6-4d77-bf2b-7e51c8bd287c).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Sapienza 47. Your targets are Sebastiano and Vincenza Lombardi. Two members of one of the biggest crime families in Central-USA.\rAfter the attempt of blowing up a former debt-slave backfired and the boss&apos; house along with his right-hand-man were blown up  by their very target the mob went quiet. Our client  is the very man who fired back. Your two targets were the people which constructed the bomb. The client actually found out about their current workplace at L&apos;Aventura Pictures.",
